# FORLORN HOPE: bursting the last thorn heart wins: Thornkeep comes down, the
# ending is told and the credits roll. A win having lost fewer than 50 earns
# the Saucer and the Alien together; the cartridge keeps the win and the
# fewest lost.
game forlorn
cheat start 1
wait 20
cheat class 1
wait 2
expect hearts == 4
cheat win
wait 2
expect hearts == 0
expect phase == 3
wait 160
expect state == 5
expect goals == 6
expect wins == 1
expect best_lost == 0
wait 130
press A
wait 5
expect state == 6
hold A 400
wait 2
press A
wait 5
expect state == 0
